    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626080/extras/6226badbb24b6045e2c412c195f635fd.avif?t=1669880203\" /></div><br><strong>Unlimited World Book: Retro</strong> is a single-player story game. The story takes place on a cold and frosty planet called <strong>Astra I</strong>. The game offers 2 episodes but the story continues also in the <strong>Unlimited World 1</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626080/extras/c16ae5173e962bf23b2539ffdce830ab.avif?t=1669880203\" /></div><br>This is the origin story of a character called <strong>Dr. Edward Retro</strong> who has a normal life in the 18th century until the <strong>Reaper</strong> came and destroyed his whole village! When he notice that he must go to the castle, the only safe place around but notice that the <strong>Reaper</strong> already got there and now our protagonist <strong>Retro</strong> has to escape from the <strong>Reaper</strong> but how will he do that? Thats your task!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626080/extras/1f1fa6d1375fc6a8c6bd0e4be754a0c9.avif?t=1669880203\" /></div><br>For this game we have planned an entire series of games which all tell a unique story!<br><br>Here is a list of what we release next &amp; might already released.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626080/extras/649830358c1eafe85713ea0495d48410.avif?t=1669880203\" /></div>",
